<title>JAPAN: Canon Sales -6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Canon Sales -6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-08-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30, 1997</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		405.36		vs	  365.97</p>
<p> Operating	   14.70		vs	   13.06</p>
<p> Current	     12.79		vs	   11.02</p>
<p> Net		    5.90		vs	    4.44</p>
<p> EPS		   41.17 yen	  vs	   35.85 yen</p>
<p> Shares	    150 million	  vs	 125 million</p>
<p> Interim div	  8.25 yen	  vs	    7.50 yen</p>
<p> -Commem div	  2.00 yen	  vs		 -</p>
<p>NOTE - Canon Sales Co Inc is the sole distributor of Canon products in Japan.</p>
